, "name": "w11", "params": {"css_class": "dnd-module", "module_id": 217287090745}, "rowMetaData": [], "rows": [], "type": "module", "w": 12, "x": 0}}], "type": "cell", "w": 12, "x": 0}}, {"0": {"cells": [], "cssClass": "", "cssId": "", "cssStyle": "", "name": "cell_17842927878346", "params": {"css_class": "dnd-column"}, "rowMetaData": [{"cssClass": "dnd-row"}], "rows": [{"0": {"cells": [], "cssClass": "", "cssId": "", "cssStyle": "", "label": "quantum-rich-text", "name": "w3", "params": {"css_class": "dnd-module", "maxw": "full", "module_id": 217248524682, "prose": "<h2>The hidden costs killing your profits</h2><div class=q-cards><div class=q-card><h4>Your team is drowning in manual work</h4><p>Hours lost to repetitive tasks that should be automated.</p></div><div class=q-card><h4>Systems don't talk</h4><p>Data silos creating blind spots and duplicate work.</p></div><div class=q-card><h4>Revenue slipping through the cracks</h4><p>Leads going cold, deals stalling, opportunities missed.</p></div><div class=q-card><h4>Can't see what's happening</h4><p>No single source of truth across your operations.</p></div><div class=q-card><h4>Expensive tools collecting dust</h4><p>Paying for software that never got properly implemented.</p></div><div class=q-card><h4>Growth harder than it should be</h4><p>Scaling means hiring more people instead of working smarter.</p></div></div>"}, "rowMetaData": [], "rows": [], "type": "module", "w": 0, "x": 0}}], "type": "cell", "w": 0, "x": 0}}, {"0": {"cells": [], "cssClass": "", "cssId": "", "cssStyle": "", "name": "cell_178429278783410", "params": {"css_class": "dnd-column"}, "rowMetaData": [{"cssClass": "dnd-row"}], "rows": [{"0": {"cells": [], "cssClass": "", "cssId": "", "cssStyle": "", "label": "quantum-rich-text", "name": "w4", "params": {"css_class": "dnd-module", "maxw": "wide", "module_id": 217248524682, "prose": "<h2>Change the game with the only growth agency HubSpot, ZoomInfo, and ConnectAndSell depend on for customer success</h2><p>We are a top-tier partner with the best sales and marketing tech providers in the world, the only growth agency that HubSpot, ZoomInfo, and ConnectAndSell hand-pick to deliver outstanding results for their clients. Using world-class tools, we revolutionize sales and marketing performance with our comprehensive approach to the Revenue Generation cycle that optimizes conversion rates.</p>"}, "rowMetaData": [], "rows": [], "type": "module", "w": 0, "x": 0}}], "type": "cell", "w": 0, "x": 0}}, {"0": {"cells": [], "cssClass": "", "cssId": "", "cssStyle": "", "name": "cell_178429278783414", "params": {"css_class": "dnd-column"}, "rowMetaData": [{"cssClass": "dnd-row"}], "rows": [{"0": {"cells": [], "cssClass": "", "cssId": "", "cssStyle": "", "label": "quantum-rich-text", "name": "w5", "params": {"css_class": "dnd-module", "maxw": "full", "module_id": 217248524682, "prose": "<h2>Most firms sell tools. We deliver outcomes.</h2><p>We don't implement AI, HubSpot, or automation in isolation. We design systems that increase profit, reduce friction, and scale without adding complexity.</p><div class=q-cards><div class=q-card><h4>Outcome-first approach</h4><p>Every engagement starts with your P and L, not a product pitch.</p></div><div class=q-card><h4>Unified systems</h4><p>AI, automation, and ops work together as one engine.</p></div><div class=q-card><h4>Measurable ROI</h4><p>You'll see the impact in your numbers within 90 days.</p></div></div>"}, "rowMetaData": [], "rows": [], "type": "module", "w": 0, "x": 0}}], "type": "cell", "w": 0, "x": 0}}, {"0": {"cells": [], "cssClass": "", "cssId": "", "cssStyle": "", "name": "cell_178429278783418", "params": {"css_class": "dnd-column"}, "rowMetaData": [{"cssClass": "dnd-row"}], "rows": [{"0": {"cells": [], "cssClass": "", "cssId": "", "cssStyle": "", "label": "quantum-rich-text", "name": "w6", "params": {"css_class": "dnd-module", "maxw": "wide", "module_id": 217248524682, "prose": "<h2>Delivering inbound marketing and outbound sales success</h2><p>We empower businesses aspiring to boost their sales by 20 percent or more and amplify their sales velocity by 10 times within 180 days. We lift the burden for them by evaluating and systemizing their go-to-market strategy, building integrated, automated sales and marketing platforms, and delivering services that optimize revenue operations.</p>"}, "rowMetaData": [], "rows": [], "type": "module", "w": 0, "x": 0}}], "type": "cell", "w": 0, "x": 0}}, {"0": {"cells": [], "cssClass": "", "cssId": "", "cssStyle": "", "name": "cell_178429278783422", "params": {"css_class": "dnd-column"}, "rowMetaData": [{"cssClass": "dnd-row"}, {"cssClass": "dnd-row"}], "rows": [{"0": {"cells": [], "cssClass": "", "cssId": "", "cssStyle": "", "name": "c7", "params": {"css_class": "dnd-column"}, "rowMetaData": [], "rows": [], "type": "cell", "w": 12, "x": 0}}, {"0": {"cells": [], "cssClass": "", "cssId": "", "cssStyle": "", "label": "quantum-rich-text", "name": "w7", "params": {"css_class": "dnd-module", "maxw": "wide", "module_id": 217248524682, "prose": "<h2>We deliver a faster time to value than any other growth agency</h2><p>Our focus on optimization, automation, and systematization is key to success. This holistic strategy not only drives top-line sales growth, it enhances overall business value by modernizing and elevating your team's capabilities, processes, and technological tools.</p>"}, "rowMetaData": [], "rows": [], "type": "module", "w": 0, "x": 0}}], "type": "cell", "w": 0, "x": 0}}, {"0": {"cells": [], "cssClass": "", "cssId": "", "cssStyle": "", "name": "cell_1784292787835", "params": {"css_class": "dnd-column"}, "rowMetaData": [{"cssClass": "dnd-row"}, {"cssClass": "dnd-row"}], "rows": [{"0": {"cells": [], "cssClass": "", "cssId": "", "cssStyle": "", "name": "c8", "params": {"css_class": "dnd-column"}, "rowMetaData": [], "rows": [], "type": "cell", "w": 12, "x": 0}}, {"0": {"cells": [], "cssClass": "", "cssId": "", "cssStyle": "", "label": "quantum-ser